  "about_ministry": "About Ministry",
  "about_ministry...": "Arise and Shine Heavenly Embassy is a Christ-centered ministry with a mission to transform lives through the love of God and the power of His Word.",
  "about_pastor": "About Apostle Bulldozer Mwamposa",
  "about_pastor...": "Apostle Bulldozer Mwamposa is the visionary and lead pastor of Arise and Shine Heavenly Embassy. Known for his dynamic preaching, unwavering faith, and passionate commitment to spreading the Gospel, Apostle Mwamposa is a servant leader dedicated to empowering believers and transforming lives. His ministry is marked by a powerful anointing for healing, deliverance, and prophetic declarations that inspire hope and ignite spiritual revival. \n\nWith a heart for discipleship and community transformation, Apostle Mwamposa has spearheaded numerous initiatives to address spiritual, emotional, and physical needs within communities. He is deeply committed to raising leaders, equipping them with the Word of God, and preparing them to carry the light of Christ into the world.",
